      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency it looks like one-sided nerve hearing loss needing a scan, but I'd like to confirm i'll request an MRI of the internal auditory canals, it'll help with asymmetric hearing loss one-sided tinnitus with hearing loss always gets a scan, it's usually benign have I covered everything you wanted?"
